@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Group pins that are close together
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Teammate" as actor
box "Frontend — Mondino web app" #E0F2FE
  participant "GlobeView" as view
  participant "GlobePage" as page
  participant "placePins" as placer
  participant "groupPins" as grouper
  participant "placeLabels" as labels
  participant "PinLayer" as layer
end box
loop the first frame, each frame in which the globe has turned, and each resize
  view --> page : viewChange(GlobeViewport: widthPx, project)
end
page -> placer : pins, views, viewport, selectedId, selected group
placer -> placer : One place for each city; project each once;\ndrop the far side (L2-011)
placer -> grouper : points facing the viewer, radiusPx (20, or 40 past 40 teammates),\nselectedId, held group
grouper -> grouper : Selected teammate's pin stands alone;\nthe held group stays one placement
grouper -> grouper : Nearest the viewer first: each ungrouped point seeds a group\nand takes the points within radiusPx, found in a grid (L2-013)
grouper --> placer : Pins alone and group pins with a count
placer -> labels : placements, width, compact = box under 500 px
labels --> placer : A side for each pin alone's label, inside the globe\nand clear of other pins, or none (L2-013)
placer --> page : PinPlacement[], west to east
page -> layer : placements, selectedId, selected group key
layer -> layer : Reuse the elements that stay, by key; remove the rest
layer --> actor : No pin covers another; a pin alone keeps its label
actor -> layer : Select a group pin
layer --> page : selectGroup(placement)
page -> page : selectedId = null; the group is held
page -> view : facing = the group pin's position
view -> view : Turn to the group pin and hold (L2-009)
page --> actor : The group pin stays lifted and pressed; its panel is journey 14's (L2-023)
@enduml
